#------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#   PDCCH Power Boost
#------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Check PDCCH Power Boost
    [Documentation]                Generic test for 1586-M2 to Check PDCCH Power is Boosted by 3dB while
    ...                             PRB Blanking is used
    [Arguments]                    ${param}        ${alias}
    Point AF_PATH to current sw package
    Point ENB_BUILD to luashark sw package
    5GC001586_Keywords.TC 1586M2-5gCall     ${param}        ${alias}
